dAir13M4", "iPadAir13M4Cellular-iPadAir13M4Cellular"], "advisories": [], "kind": "software", "screenshotUrls": [], "ipadScreenshotUrls": [], "appletvScreenshotUrls": [], "artworkUrl512": "https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/f3/b2/66/f3b2668f-c8ce-b351-a1c7-d3fc972bcdf9/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007epad-0-1-85-220.png/512x512bb.jpg", "artistViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/developer/michel-bonzon/id6787120241?uo=4", "artworkUrl60": "https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/f3/b2/66/f3b2668f-c8ce-b351-a1c7-d3fc972bcdf9/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007epad-0-1-85-220.png/60x60bb.jpg", "artworkUrl100": "https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/f3/b2/66/f3b2668f-c8ce-b351-a1c7-d3fc972bcdf9/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007epad-0-1-85-220.png/100x100bb.jpg", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion": 0, "artistId": 6787120241, "artistName": "MICHEL BONZON", "genres": ["유틸리티", "생산성"], "price": 9900.0, "bundleId": "com.mbonzon.calculfiabilite", "trackId": 6787120239, "trackName": "Reliability Pro", "sellerName": "MICHEL BONZON", "releaseDate": "2026-07-09T07:27:31Z", "genreIds": ["6002", "6007"], "primaryGenreName": "Utilities", "primaryGenreId": 6002, "isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled": true, "currentVersionReleaseDate": "2026-07-09T07:27:31Z", "version": "1.0.0", "wrapperType": "software", "currency": "KRW", "description": "Reliability Pro is the essential reference tool for engineers, technicians, and quality managers in the electronics and mechanical fields. Designed to be fast and intuitive, this application allows you to perform all your reliability and lifespan calculations directly in the field or in the laboratory.\n\nThe application is divided into 4 professional modules:\n\nTHEORETICAL MODEL (Arrhenius Law)\nEvaluate equipment reliability by degrading the nominal MTBF (25°C) based on real-world thermal operating constraints. This module includes the automatic calculation of the exact probabilities of reliability (R) and failure (F) over the defined operating period.\n\nFITs ANALYSIS (BOM)\nSum the FITs (Failures in Time) of all the components on your electronic boards. The application adjusts each FIT according to its local temperature to identify critical vulnerabilities, calculate the overall system MTBF, and evaluate the probabilities of reliability (R) and failure (F) for a target mission.\n\nHARDWARE TESTS (Test Bench)\nConsolidate your accelerated aging test data from climate chambers. Extract the actual physical MTBF at 25°C from heterogeneous test times (with or without failures), then project it to your customers' conditions to automatically calculate the associated probabilities of reliability and failure.\n\nEXTRAPOLATION (Ns/No Statistics)\nQualify your production batches against contractual requirements. Starting from an initial population (No) and the survivors (Ns) after a thermal stress test, instantly estimate the standard MTBF (25°C) and the MTBF at your target operating temperature. Then, project this data to the target duration to accurately determine the batch's probabilities of survival (reliability) and failure.\n\nADDITIONAL FEATURES:\n• Export professional reports in PDF format (dated and formatted).\n• Save, export, and load data (JSON/CSV).\n• Application fully translated into English, French, German, Italian, and Spanish.", "minimumOsVersion": "15.1", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 0, "sellerUrl": "https://power.genart.ch/formation/", "languageCodesISO2A": ["EN"], "fileSizeBytes": "30485504", "formattedPrice": "￦9,900", "trackContentRating": "4+", "averageUserRating": 0, "trackCensoredName": "Reliability Pro", "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/reliability-pro/id6787120239?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating": "4+", "userRatingCount": 0}]}